{"generated": "2026-10-23 18:55", "brief": "<b>1. SK하이닉스, 솔리다임 美 상장 철회 및 자금 조달 재편</b>\nSK하이닉스가 주주가치 제고와 중복상장 논란 등을 고려해 자회사 솔리다임의 미국 증시 상장(IPO) 검토를 전격 중단했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE4wWERPNjRIcS12TFVqYlhhdHJ0TmJWbkhaYlluMmpPUmJUVEVuT0I5Tm96cXVIbm4yX3BFenVYQ01ZRmtKbGtHV0ctTkR0QUU2ZzJjOUpueXhLdTJFOFoyRzdzZFY?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5xbDF2cWZrLXkwbF9lVkdjdTlySFJjYTBNdUFuakNJaWNva0tuZmxtWmxvbnkyQXU1cnRTTmtfdjhEdV9hTDNncjd4Zk1xSGtlQlRNWWg2V3d3bGJsaGtMZi0wZHFTS0E?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#18</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE4wWW5qU2NORE5nSXcyb2lqeGx6SUU4cHd0ZEVHWjl6RHVmbmx4ZUZHM1EtOTc5M25WQWlxNGpDaDNxajlONlVSVW1saTdmYWZXdVg2ckFreXRRRUc4QmVfU1M4QXF2UFhzQVE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a>]. 이에 따라 SK하이닉스는 미국 낸드 공장 가동 및 투자 자금 확보를 위해 해외 투자 유치나 유상증자 등 새로운 자금 조달 방안(플랜B)을 모색해야 하는 과제를 안게 됐습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTFBRUlFBWWY4NFk1NnFCUDlNRFNNNks5ZHVrZHdMeW9PWGYwbzVYNXpYbTJHMWJTRzlTOFB3UFpkM2F1a1RyTnFOOGdFbWFmUzJadkliSDQzcjlCQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9mY0FtTS11QUxUbVdIU28zZmNaNDNlUG0xYkhoSnN2QUpfWk1pekNFcDZXU1JPamZBZFg5Y3ZfRWgzbHhqVjd4blBOeTBheG9CVHMxUFN6Yjk0dw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#31</a>].\n\n<b>2. 기업 경영권 분쟁 및 주주 관련 소송 격화</b>\n고려아연이 MBK파트너스와 영풍을 상대로 낸 1조 1,433억 원 규모의 손해배상 청구 소송에서 승소하며 경영권 분쟁이 새로운 국면을 맞이했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE9wMVNrT3ZzQU5uTkNBUlN1QTVseEVqdkJIb3VRc0JKUGtFUjRpM1lrdGVrYnZPcFdDNzdrRnB4RWJOdmdTLTNhaHU2U244SXY3Vm52cE9zZHZ5aEV1OWdxX2lLc0xJZjZ2eE9NRjZzMHpLUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#19</a>]. 또한 코퍼스코리아가 장부등열람허용가처분 신청 피소 소식을 알리는 등 국내 기업 전반에서 경영권 주도권을 둘러싼 법적 공방이 지속되고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE9FUzBPNk1XNG1YdTNYaEp4LWh1Y0lNdjhiZlpZRkFkellXUDBwcV9LR0pVQzdkNHdqemlMZ2o5dTRvZ1luTWpOR01VbkhRcmVObThDZzFHQk1kNDM1NlQ5cTROS0VZM2NQd3BrZUduMUNhaXM?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a>].\n\n<b>3. 우리금융그룹, 추가 출자 일축 및 주주환원·자본 방어 집중</b>\n우리금융그룹이 동양·ABL생명 등 통합 보험사에 대한 추가 출자 계획이 없음을 명확히 선을 그었습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFB2S29CNnFfY0s1NzNhVnZhdHl4Z1hyTVY3cjYtZVFfNDIxaHBmdmpLRFF1cVJBVkJhU0pyTjN3enlmRHBzNFo3bmNFZW1iTGk3SHYzMHBvSjJuU3M?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#23</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQeTZXSWItU0ZxSGh4V2ltcGF6dFVNZ0xvSjZndjZQc1FLSnV2LTFDZ3ItYWc3OGxfV05KMDE0REt5VFhNcVhlenFmeXpmQmNoeVgtZmd4WlduVzVkYVVOQ1JhUkowM09tVUxWbWJzQWtFQ2tQWVBXVzc5NWFneUUyQUVGdw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE9iaTkxMkxfM2h1N3hROWhRb1daM3dQMzMyR2hsaUZhYjdaN00xZ2k4THpTeGFPSVAxTnhHc1FhQ25aTzJ4RDY2QkxpWUFiSDVpZmFyTG5GaDZqTVQ0Z1oxYWI3SFdnbjIyellJaUpMQ21FbWRR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#33</a>]. 우리금융은 ABL생명 사옥 매각을 통해 자본을 방어하는 한편, 주주환원율 50% 목표 달성과 비과세 배당 재원 확보 등 주주가치 제고에 집중하겠다는 전략을 밝혔습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFB2S29CNnFfY0s1NzNhVnZhdHl4Z1hyTVY3cjYtZVFfNDIxaHBmdmpLRFF1cVJBVkJhU0pyTjN3enlmRHBzNFo3bmNFZW1iTGk3SHYzMHBvSjJuU3M?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#23</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQeTZXSWItU0ZxSGh4V2ltcGF6dFVNZ0xvSjZndjZQc1FLSnV2LTFDZ3ItYWc3OGxfV05KMDE0REt5VFhNcVhlenFmeXpmQmNoeVgtZmd4WlduVzVkYVVOQ1JhUkowM09tVUxWbWJzQWtFQ2tQWVBXVzc5NWFneUUyQUVGdw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE9iaTkxMkxfM2h1N3hROWhRb1daM3dQMzMyR2hsaUZhYjdaN00xZ2k4THpTeGFPSVAxTnhHc1FhQ25aTzJ4RDY2QkxpWUFiSDVpZmFyTG5GaDZqTVQ0Z1oxYWI3SFdnbjIyellJaUpMQ21FbWRR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#33</a>].\n\n<b>4. 글로벌 기술·플랫폼 기업 IPO 및 M&amp;A 동향</